# What this module needs on the machine, name | kind | locator | policy | consumer | reason.
# The format and the kinds are documented in the repository root AGENTS.md. This file names
# tools and never how to install one, since that mapping is DEPENDENCIES.map one layer up.
# Written by hand, because this module has no sub units to fold declarations from.
rex | app | com.superlogical.rex | required | SETTINGS | the application this entire module configures
lazygit | path | lazygit | optional | .config/rex/tools/lazygit.sh | the lazygit floating pane, the binding is dead without it | brew | lazygit
git | path | git | required | .config/rex/tools/lazygit.sh | deciding whether the calling pane sits in a repository | brew | git
fzf | path | fzf | required | .config/rex/tools/find.sh, .config/rex/tools/lazygit.sh | the picker in the finder and the recent repository list | brew | fzf
fd | path | fd | required | .config/rex/tools/find.sh | listing the folders and files the picker ranks | brew | fd
nvim | path | nvim | optional | .config/rex/tools/find.sh | opening a chosen file, choosing a folder still works without it | brew | neovim
lf | path | lf | optional | .config/rex/tools/browse.sh | the file browser floating pane, the binding is dead without it | brew | lf
jq | path | jq | required | .config/rex/tools/find.sh | reading whether the calling pane is free | brew | jq
osascript | path | osascript | required | .config/rex/tools/find.sh, .config/rex/tools/lazygit.sh | the notification that is the only feedback once a floating pane has closed | macos | ships with macOS
rex-cli | path | rex | required | .config/rex/tools/find.sh | sending the chosen place to the calling pane, or opening it as a new tab, and Rex puts it on PATH in every floating pane
